    <bpmn:process id="W_W3762" name="W3762. Career Site, Candidate Portal &amp; Talent Content Product Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: EVP launch (W3761); site lifecycle; content refresh cycle
Frequency: Maintained + continuous
Volume: Enterprise career site &amp; candidate portal
Owner: TA Marketing / Digital (TA)
Participants: TA Marketing, IT/Digital (links to VS-27/VS-75), Marketing (links to VS-14.2), HR Shared Services (links to VS-103.1), Data Privacy (links to VS-91), Analytics (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3762 — Career Site, Candidate Portal &amp; Talent Content Product Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3762_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3762_Lane1" name="TA Marketing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3762_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3762_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3762_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3762_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3762_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3762_Start3" name="EVP launch (W3761); site lifecycle; content refresh cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3762_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3762_Task4" name="TA Marketing/Digital own the career-site product (careers.buildright.com.ph)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Marketing/Digital own the career-site product (careers.buildright.com.ph): job-search and apply flow, mobile-first experience, location/role landing pages for 200 stores + 4 DCs + HQ, BuildRight story/EVP pages, employee-story content, FAQ, and SEO so roles are discoverable; manage as a continuously improved digital product (links to VS-75 product discipline)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Digital
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3762_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3762_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3762_Task5" name="TA Marketing/HR Shared Services operate the candidate portal: candidate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TA Marketing/HR Shared Services operate the candidate portal: candidate account, application status, document upload, interview self-scheduling, offer-letter e-sign, consent and data-privacy capture (links to VS-91 — candidate PIA/DPIA, retention), and integration to the ATS/HRIS (links to VS-103.3)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / HR Shared Services / IT
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3762_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3762_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3762_Task6" name="TA Marketing/Analytics instrument the funnel (visits, apply-start…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: TA Marketing/Analytics instrument the funnel (visits, apply-start, apply-complete, drop-off by step/source), publish content-performance analytics, and run continuous conversion-rate optimization on the career site and apply flow (links to W3784)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Analytics
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3762_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3762_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3762_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3762_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3762_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-592 (ensure controlled execution — Employer Brand, EVP &amp; Talent Marketing Strategy (PA-121.1).) | - operational: funnel instrumentation with CRO (conversion-rate-optimization) testing; operational: PIA/DPIA and consent capture (links to VS-91)
Owner: TA Marketing / Digital (TA)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3762_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3762_Annotation8" targetRef="W3762_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
