    <bpmn:process id="W_W3763" name="W3763. Talent Marketing Campaign Planning &amp; Channel Strategy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual TA plan (links to VS-33.1); hiring surge; hard-to-fill role
Frequency: Annual + per campaign
Volume: Enterprise talent-marketing calendar
Owner: TA Marketing
Participants: TA Marketing, TA/Recruiting (links to VS-19.1), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Marketing (links to VS-14.1/VS-14.2), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Analytics (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3763 — Talent Marketing Campaign Planning &amp; Channel Strategy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3763_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3763_Lane1" name="TA Marketing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3763_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3763_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3763_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3763_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3763_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3763_Start3" name="Annual TA plan (links to VS-33.1); hiring surge; hard-to-fill role">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3763_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3763_Task4" name="TA Marketing/Recruiting build the annual talent-marketing plan and channel…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Marketing/Recruiting build the annual talent-marketing plan and channel strategy aligned to the hiring plan (links to VS-19.1 requisition forecast): always-on job advertising, targeted campaigns for hard-to-fill segments (trade-knowledgeable frontline, digital/IT, supply chain), regional/store-opening spikes (links to VS-37), seasonal hiring (links to W555), and channel mix (job boards, social, referral links to W715, campus links to W3777, agency links to W3768)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Recruiting
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead / CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3763_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3763_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3763_Task5" name="TA Marketing execute campaigns: creative production (links to VS-14.1), media…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TA Marketing execute campaigns: creative production (links to VS-14.1), media buying and posting, audience targeting (social/programmatic), landing-page and apply-flow optimization (links to W3762), and integration to loyalty/customer channels where relevant (BuildRight&#x27;s ~600K loyalty members and trade accounts are a candidate pool — links to VS-13/VS-43)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Marketing
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Per campaign</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3763_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3763_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3763_Task6" name="TA Marketing/Analytics measure channel ROI (cost-per-application…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: TA Marketing/Analytics measure channel ROI (cost-per-application, cost-per-hire, source-of-hire, time-to-fill, quality-of-hire by source) and reallocate spend to highest-yield channels (links to W3784/W3768)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Analytics
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3763_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3763_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3763_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3763_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3763_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-592 (ensure controlled execution — Employer Brand, EVP &amp; Talent Marketing Strategy (PA-121.1).) | - operational: source-of-hire analytics; operational: always-on pipeline and pre-built campaign kits
Owner: TA Marketing</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
