    <bpmn:process id="W_W3765" name="W3765. Employer Brand Measurement, Brand Health &amp; Benchmarking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual; brand-health survey cycle; benchmark cycle
Frequency: Annual + quarterly pulse
Volume: Enterprise brand-health measurement
Owner: TA Marketing / Analytics
Participants: TA Marketing, Analytics (links to VS-28.1), HR/EX (links to VS-103.2), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Insights (links to VS-44)
Source: workflow W3765 — Employer Brand Measurement, Brand Health &amp; Benchmarking</bpmn:documentation>
