        <bpmn:outgoing>W3765_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3765_Task4" name="TA Marketing/Analytics define and maintain the employer-brand KPI framework…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Marketing/Analytics define and maintain the employer-brand KPI framework: brand awareness and consideration in target talent segments, employer Net Promoter Score (eNPS — candidate and employee), career-site funnel metrics (links to W3762), social/reputation metrics (links to W3764), candidate NPS (links to W3776), and TA funnel economics (links to W3784)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Analytics
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3765_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3765_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3765_Task5" name="TA Marketing/Insights run brand-health research: external candidate-market…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TA Marketing/Insights run brand-health research: external candidate-market surveys (awareness, perception, intent-to-apply by segment/region), competitive employer benchmarking (peer retailers, logistics, digital employers in PH), and internal employee-brand-perception pulse (links to VS-103.2 engagement)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Insights
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Annual + pulse</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3765_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3765_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3765_Task6" name="TA Marketing publish brand-health and benchmarking to CHRO and executive (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: TA Marketing publish brand-health and benchmarking to CHRO and executive (links to VS-33/VS-36), translate insights into EVP/channel actions (links to W3761/W3763), and track brand-health trend over time
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Analytics
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3765_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3765_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3765_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3765_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
