        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-592 (ensure controlled execution — Employer Brand, EVP &amp; Talent Marketing Strategy (PA-121.1).) | - operational: KPI framework + research; operational: annual benchmarking
Owner: TA Marketing / Analytics</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
