    <bpmn:process id="W_W3766" name="W3766. Employee Advocacy, Storytelling &amp; Brand Ambassador Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program launch; story pipeline cadence
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: Enterprise advocacy network
Owner: TA Marketing / EX
Participants: TA Marketing, EX (links to VS-103.2), Store Ops (links to VS-07), DC Ops (links to VS-04), Comms (links to VS-14.3), Marketing (links to VS-14.2)
Source: workflow W3766 — Employee Advocacy, Storytelling &amp; Brand Ambassador Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3766_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3766_Lane1" name="TA Marketing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3766_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3766_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3766_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3766_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3766_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3766_Start3" name="Program launch; story pipeline cadence">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3766_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3766_Task4" name="TA Marketing/EX build and run the employee advocacy and brand-ambassador…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Marketing/EX build and run the employee advocacy and brand-ambassador program: recruit employee ambassadors across stores/DCs/HQ (reflecting diversity of role, region, gender, tenure), an advocacy platform (social-share tool), content kits, and guidelines; integrate to recognition (links to W630)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / EX / Store Ops
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3766_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3766_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3766_Task5" name="TA Marketing produce authentic employee storytelling: career-path stories…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TA Marketing produce authentic employee storytelling: career-path stories (cashier → department supervisor → store manager; stock associate → DC lead), trade-mastery stories, long-service (links to W973), and women-in-trades / DEI stories; publish to career site (links to W3762), social (links to W3764), and internal channels
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Comms
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3766_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3766_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3766_Task6" name="TA Marketing/Analytics measure advocacy reach/engagement and its contribution…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: TA Marketing/Analytics measure advocacy reach/engagement and its contribution to apply volume and source-of-hire, and report to TA governance (links to W3784)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Analytics
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3766_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3766_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3766_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3766_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
