    <bpmn:process id="W_W3767" name="W3767. Diversity Recruiting Brand, Inclusive Hiring Marketing &amp; Accessibility" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DEI strategy (links to VS-103.2/W719); program cycle
Frequency: Annual + ongoing
Volume: Enterprise inclusive-hiring marketing
Owner: TA Marketing / DEI
Participants: TA Marketing, DEI (links to VS-103.2/W719), HR (links to VS-19/VS-103), Compliance (links to VS-22), Store Ops (links to VS-07), PWD/Senior programs (links to VS-85)
Source: workflow W3767 — Diversity Recruiting Brand, Inclusive Hiring Marketing &amp; Accessibility</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3767_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3767_Lane1" name="TA Marketing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3767_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3767_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3767_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3767_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3767_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3767_Start3" name="DEI strategy (links to VS-103.2/W719); program cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3767_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3767_Task4" name="TA Marketing/DEI build the inclusive-hiring brand and marketing: outreach to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Marketing/DEI build the inclusive-hiring brand and marketing: outreach to underrepresented talent (women in trades/construction, PWD, solo parents, indigenous/region-specific, veterans/equivalent), inclusive imagery/language in career site (links to W3762) and campaigns (links to W3763), and partnerships with relevant organizations
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / DEI
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead / CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3767_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3767_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3767_Task5" name="TA Marketing/HR ensure accessible candidate experience: accessible career site…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TA Marketing/HR ensure accessible candidate experience: accessible career site and portal (WCAG), accessible apply/interview process, reasonable-accommodation process for candidates (links to VS-83 occupational health where relevant), and inclusive job descriptions (bias-checked)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / HR / IT
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3767_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3767_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3767_Task6" name="TA Marketing/Analytics measure diversity of the candidate funnel and hire…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: TA Marketing/Analytics measure diversity of the candidate funnel and hire composition by segment, report to DEI governance (links to VS-103.2) and CHRO, and ensure lawful/consented data handling (links to VS-91)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Analytics / DEI
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3767_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3767_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3767_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3767_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
