        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-592 (ensure controlled execution — Employer Brand, EVP &amp; Talent Marketing Strategy (PA-121.1).) | - operational: inclusive-hiring training and funnel measurement; operational: consent and RA 10173 handling (links to VS-91)
Owner: TA Marketing / DEI</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
