    <bpmn:process id="W_W3768" name="W3768. TA Marketing Budget, Agency/Channel Governance &amp; Vendor Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget (links to VS-33.1); vendor cycle; performance review
Frequency: Annual + ongoing
Volume: TA marketing budget; agency &amp; channel vendor portfolio
Owner: TA Marketing / Finance / Procurement
Participants: TA Marketing, Finance (links to VS-17.4), Procurement (links to VS-34/VS-03), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Recruiting (links to VS-19.1), Compliance (links to VS-22)
Source: workflow W3768 — TA Marketing Budget, Agency/Channel Governance &amp; Vendor Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3768_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3768_Lane1" name="TA Marketing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3768_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3768_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3768_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3768_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3768_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3768_Start3" name="Annual budget (links to VS-33.1); vendor cycle; performance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3768_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3768_Task4" name="TA Marketing/Finance develop the TA-marketing and sourcing-channel budget…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Marketing/Finance develop the TA-marketing and sourcing-channel budget: job-board/social spend, agency/search-firm fees, campus/events (links to W3777), referral incentives (links to W715), advocacy/content production, and tooling (ATS/career-site/CRM); align to annual HR/TA budget (links to VS-33.1/VS-17.4)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Finance
Accountable (A): CHRO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3768_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3768_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3768_Task5" name="TA Marketing/Procurement/Legal govern the agency and channel-vendor portfolio…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TA Marketing/Procurement/Legal govern the agency and channel-vendor portfolio: RFP and contract recruitment-process-outsourcing (RPO), contingency/retained search firms, job boards, and sourcing platforms; SLAs (time-to-present, placement-quality, fee structure, replacement guarantee), data-privacy and anti-bribery terms (links to VS-91/VS-86.3), and performance review
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Procurement / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per vendor + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3768_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3768_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3768_Task6" name="TA Marketing/Finance publish TA-marketing and agency-spend analytics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: TA Marketing/Finance publish TA-marketing and agency-spend analytics (cost-per-hire, agency ROI, channel yield), drive vendor consolidation and channel optimization (links to W3763/W3784), and report to CHRO and Finance
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Finance / Analytics
Accountable (A): TA Marketing Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3768_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3768_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3768_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3768_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3768_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-124 (ensure lawful &amp; consented candidate data handling.) | - operational: internal pipeline + agency governance; operational: due diligence and contract terms
Owner: TA Marketing / Finance / Procurement</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
